msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The core part of Quarkus 3.33 LTS is based on Quarkus 3.32 with some "
"additional fixes included in 3.33.1."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.33.1[3.33.1] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

